  <NAME>RNA-seq profiling of A549 cells with sgRNA knockouts that confer prexasertib resistance</NAME>
  <TITLE>RNA-seq profiling of A549 cells with sgRNA knockouts that confer prexasertib resistance</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>A549 cells with FOXM1 or LIN54 sgRNA knockout, which confers resistance to the CHK1 inhibitor prexasertib, were generated. These cells and control (empty vector) cells were synchronized in S phase, released for 1 hour and treated with 100 nM prexasertib or DMSO (vehicle) for 2 hours. RNA-seq profiling was performed to identify drug-induced perturbations in gene expression in these cells. Overall design: RNA-seq profiling of A549 cells with sgRNA knockouts that confer prexasertib resistance, compared to control A549 cells, with or without prexasertib treatment</DESCRIPTION>
